Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
