Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直相信着… 唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特也
