Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是银河眼之间的光芒。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
