Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欧比塔尔7）凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人 您还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺和凯特大人 已经差不多{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}6年151天5小时30秒的交情了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人在作为哈鲁特大人的看护者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把俺制造到了这个世界上。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那之后的俺不分昼夜连一觉都没睡过{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被强加了看护哈鲁特大人的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算坏了 就算坏了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺也像不死鸟一样复活过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还被改造成了 No.猎人专用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回想起来 全都是痛苦的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 到底想说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个… 那个 就是说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺对哈鲁特大人和凯特大人的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是什么都清楚就是这么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人，您以为俺没注意到您那眼神吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和哈特兰德决斗的那时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人的眼神……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太见外了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请稍微多依赖俺一点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要是为了凯特大人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这条命什么的俺一点都不吝惜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了我和哈鲁特不惜豁出性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你存在的意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了！ 不愧是凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺要把俺的系统
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}链接到凯特大人的大脑里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要当我的眼睛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)系统 链接开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同步率100% 链接完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 别再做多余的事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有俺在海马大人就是百人之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 轮到俺了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说了那才是多余的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知、知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《海马：米扎艾尔使用的银河冲击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也和我用同样的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来作为同样使用银河眼的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和那家伙的卡组里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱 几乎一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒那家伙果然还是得靠传说中的龙…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((快斗：这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说中描绘的光之龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是新的银河眼·光子·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吗？))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果我的信念是真的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一定是为了相信着我而消逝的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且也是为了我托付了未来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马、星光体》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里一定有着我们的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 升阶银河！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并装备这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降的光子龙之类的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不是对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动「升阶魔法-银河」的更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以和装备的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:11:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为相同等级的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「升阶魔法-银河」进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是我的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是我们最后的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！银河究极龙 No.62！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)宇宙中徘徊的光与暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在其夹缝中沉睡的悲哀的龙们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.09,0:12:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那份力量汇聚起来 打开真实之门！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·原初·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这条龙是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.是映照人类希望的镜子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今在此 银河眼·光子·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.57,0:13:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的手中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得了星光界的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为 No.转生重生。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的银河眼变成了 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·原初·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的 No.在月球上诞生了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 那个就是刻在石碑上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗的胜者将获得 No.代码的钥匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔 就在这里 将我们的因缘做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟谁才是最强的龙使！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动普莱姆·光子龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次，将场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1级！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让新·塔奇翁提升阶级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}普莱姆·光子！攻击新·塔奇翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力更高的新·塔奇翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)就在这个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动普莱姆·光子龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升场上怪兽阶级合计
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘以200点的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}普莱姆·光子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和新·塔奇翁的阶级合计是19！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力上升3800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力7800！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永恒光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！ 成功了 海马大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 看到那颗圆圆的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就想起来了 大宝贝先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份英姿真想让他看到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺和海马大人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在英勇地战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哔哔… 唔咕！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你在干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大宝贝 感受到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 感受到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以想让他看到 他的身姿！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说～ 因为外界的影响{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}系统 已经宕机了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱的力量 伟大！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人！ 站起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:15:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈鲁特)哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈鲁特)哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥在战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实是 凯特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 虽然可能召唤出了新的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但胜负 还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 塔奇恩·混沌·洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场上的塔奇恩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……消失吧！原始光子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原始光子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去可不妙！快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！要是输了快斗就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合将会是决定胜负的分水岭。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 快斗大人 无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都由我来守护！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}墓地里的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空混沌洞的追加效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以通过跳过自己的抽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀！快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是 超银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的生命值是 2500。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨了这一击……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你这家伙的场上 空空如也！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这招 决出胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 双重龙之落穴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的龙族怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上若没有自己的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只龙族怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(心龙)快斗 这里交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有些话 无论如何都必须传达给他。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧，我相信你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.46！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神影龙 德拉古鲁恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 No.是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（人龙）好久不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.66,0:18:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔 我还没有把真相告诉你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧看看发生在你身上的真相！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双重·龙· dissent的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 通过这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与进行战斗的怪兽攻击力相同！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火炎神激！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）上吧 德拉古鲁恩！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火炎神激！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（人龙）那时候 人们的怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为可憎的诅咒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当指向龙的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你试图保护我。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以舍弃自身性命的方式！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份高洁的精神让我感动得泪流不止。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而那一切{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却被那可怕之人玷污了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可怕之人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃 唐·萨赞德。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将灵魂献给米扎艾尔之龙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高傲的战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的灵魂将会转生到星幽界。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但 我不会让你如愿！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 将成为我 唐·萨赞德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活的食粮{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为屏障 复活过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都是堂·萨赞德的阴谋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他施加的诅咒。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你被堂·萨赞德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔 在这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.81,0:20:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去寻找你该走的道路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《刚才那就是我真正的记忆…》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是那家伙的…》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)心率上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体损伤 70%！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然会被堂·萨赞德！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我一直深信着的银河眼时空龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然是堂·萨赞德的诅咒吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不信！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泷王·龙竟然{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背叛我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 升阶魔法-急袭之力 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半后特殊召唤并装备这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新·泷王·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样才对。这才称得上是真正的龙使。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你无论何时都一直相信着龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一次 不要放弃自己的命运！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的龙使 是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新·升阶眼·泷王·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这一击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.70,0:23:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.93,0:23:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.32,0:23:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.19,0:23:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.75,0:23:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
